    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;99%&quot; is a first-person survival horror puzzle game set in an eerie research facility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist, having lost all memories, explores the twisted and terrifying environment in a desperate attempt to escape.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken in a dimly lit room within a dark facility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you hear are faint mechanical sounds echoing through the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have no memory of why you are here or even where you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must explore the closed-off facility, gathering records and remnants of past experiments, while confronting the lurking horrors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Controls</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move: WASD keys</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run: Shift key</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact: Left-click</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pause: ESC key</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>System</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save System</strong>: The game automatically saves at each chapter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endings</strong>: Different endings are available based on player choices.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Playtime</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The average playtime for this game is between 40 to 60 minutes, varying based on the ending and the depth of exploration.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Streaming Guidelines</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permission</strong>: Streaming is allowed without restriction for individuals and organizations alike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monetization</strong>: Allowed only if using features provided by the video streaming platform.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disclaimer</strong>: The developer holds no responsibility for any issues resulting from streaming this game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Changes</strong>: These guidelines may change without prior notice.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;99%&quot; is a first-person survival horror puzzle game set in an eerie research facility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist, having lost all memories, explores the twisted and terrifying environment in a desperate attempt to escape.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken in a dimly lit room within a dark facility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you hear are faint mechanical sounds echoing through the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have no memory of why you are here or even where you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must explore the closed-off facility, gathering records and remnants of past experiments, while confronting the lurking horrors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Controls</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move: WASD keys</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run: Shift key</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact: Left-click</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pause: ESC key</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>System</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save System</strong>: The game automatically saves at each chapter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endings</strong>: Different endings are available based on player choices.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Playtime</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The average playtime for this game is between 40 to 60 minutes, varying based on the ending and the depth of exploration.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Streaming Guidelines</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permission</strong>: Streaming is allowed without restriction for individuals and organizations alike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monetization</strong>: Allowed only if using features provided by the video streaming platform.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disclaimer</strong>: The developer holds no responsibility for any issues resulting from streaming this game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Changes</strong>: These guidelines may change without prior notice.</p></li></ul>",
